{"candidateAnswer":"Classic rock","evidence":"[D2:10 | 4:45 pm on 26 March, 2023] Dave: Wow, there were so many great bands! If I had to pick a favorite, it would definitely be Aerosmith. Their performance was incredible. I'll show you a pic I took when they were playing.\n[D28:40 | 5:46 pm on 2 November, 2023] Dave: Lately, I've been getting into classic rock. The music from that era is timeless.\n[D10:11 | 7:56 pm on 7 July, 2023] Dave: Nope, never been to Japan but I'm so keen to go one day. I've heard it's full of vibes, good eats and awesome tech. Plus, being able to experience the culture would be amazing - I'm hooked on their music!","itemId":"urn:uuid:a7a311dc-c6d9-5c00-8c5d-077feaf2a523","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c3e3bd468121efc0f2088960a3d7afa7da31e99f1d6e2d99a11e9d62542992a6","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of music does Dave listen to?","referenceAnswer":"classic rock, Japanese music","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c3e3bd468121efc0f2088960a3d7afa7da31e99f1d6e2d99a11e9d62542992a6"}}]}